Typically, when a monster disappears and reappears, he teleports 
to the up stairs to recover (you should use telepathy to check where he
goes for sure).  The standard strategy is to get to the upstairs 
and stand on them (blocking his escape route).  Then the monster will
stay put next to you while you bash him.

If the monster escapes up the stairs when you try to do this, I somtimes
follow it up the stairs, and then stand on the down stairs, and wait for
it to stand next to me.  When it does, I go downstairs, and it follows
me.  I then stand on the up stairs and bash him.
